Guided Exercise: Scale and Expose Applications to External Access
Objective
Deploy two web applications and expose them externally using:
•	OpenShift Route
•	Kubernetes Ingress
Then:
•	Enable sticky sessions
•	Scale the deployments
•	Verify load balancing between pods
________________________________________
1. Prepare the Lab Environment
lab start deploy-routes
This prepares the OpenShift cluster.
________________________________________
2. Login to OpenShift
oc login -u developer -p developer https://api.ocp4.example.com:6443
________________________________________
3. Switch to the Project
oc project web-applications
________________________________________
4. Create the First Deployment (satir-app)
oc create deployment satir-app \
--image registry.ocp4.example.com:8443/redhattraining/do180-httpd-app:v1
Verify:
oc get pods
oc get deploy/satir-app
________________________________________
5. Create the Second Deployment (sakila-app)
oc create deployment sakila-app \
--image registry.ocp4.example.com:8443/redhattraining/do180-httpd-app:v1
Verify:
oc get pods
oc get deploy
________________________________________
6. Create Services for Both Deployments
Service for satir-app
oc expose deployment satir-app \
--name satir-svc \
--port 8080 \
--target-port 8080
Service for sakila-app
oc expose deployment sakila-app \
--name sakila-svc \
--port 8080 \
--target-port 8080
Check services:
oc get services
Check endpoints:
oc get endpoints
________________________________________
7. Verify Pod IPs
oc get pods -o wide
________________________________________
8. Create an OpenShift Route (satir-app)
oc expose service satir-svc --name satir
Verify:
oc get routes
Example route:
satir-web-applications.apps.ocp4.example.com
________________________________________
9. Create a Kubernetes Ingress (sakila-app)
oc create ingress ingr-sakila \
--rule "ingr-sakila.apps.ocp4.example.com/*=sakila-svc:8080"
Verify:
oc get ingress
Check routes again:
oc get routes
Ingress automatically creates a route.
________________________________________
10. Test Access with curl
Access Ingress
curl ingr-sakila.apps.ocp4.example.com
Example output:
Welcome to Red Hat Training, from sakila-app-xxxx
Access Route
curl satir-web-applications.apps.ocp4.example.com
Example:
Welcome to Red Hat Training, from satir-app-xxxx
________________________________________
11. Scale the Deployments
Scale sakila-app to 2 pods
oc scale deployment sakila-app --replicas 2
Verify:
oc get pods
________________________________________
Scale satir-app to 3 pods
oc scale deployment satir-app --replicas 3
Verify:
oc get pods -o wide
________________________________________
12. Verify Load Balancing
Check endpoints:
oc get endpoints
Example:
sakila-svc   10.8.0.66:8080,10.8.0.67:8080
satir-svc    10.8.0.65:8080,10.8.0.69:8080,10.8.0.70:8080
Multiple pod IPs = load balancing active
________________________________________
13. Enable Sticky Sessions (Ingress)
Add cookie affinity:
oc annotate ingress ingr-sakila \
ingress.kubernetes.io/affinity=cookie
________________________________________
14. Test Load Balancing
for i in {1..10}; do
curl ingr-sakila.apps.ocp4.example.com
done
Requests go to different pods.
________________________________________
15. Save Cookie for Sticky Session
curl ingr-sakila.apps.ocp4.example.com -c /tmp/cookie_jar
Check cookie:
cat /tmp/cookie_jar
________________________________________
16. Test Sticky Session
for i in {1..10}; do
curl ingr-sakila.apps.ocp4.example.com -b /tmp/cookie_jar
done
All responses come from same pod.
________________________________________
17. Enable Sticky Sessions for Route
oc annotate route satir \
router.openshift.io/cookie_name="hello"
________________________________________
18. Test Route Load Balancing
for i in {1..10}; do
curl satir-web-applications.apps.ocp4.example.com
done
Pods change → load balanced.
________________________________________
19. Save Cookie for Route
curl satir-web-applications.apps.ocp4.example.com \
-c /tmp/cookie_jar
Verify:
cat /tmp/cookie_jar
________________________________________
20. Test Sticky Route Session
for i in {1..10}; do
curl satir-web-applications.apps.ocp4.example.com -b /tmp/cookie_jar
done
Requests stay on same pod.
________________________________________
21. Finish the Lab
lab finish deploy-routes
________________________________________
Key Concepts from this Lab
Concept	Description
Deployment	Manages application pods
Service	Internal access to pods
Route	OpenShift external access
Ingress	Kubernetes external access
Scaling	Increasing pod replicas
Load Balancing	Traffic distributed across pods
Sticky Session	Client always connects to same pod

